          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature successfully Shoves or Trips you, or you fail a saving throw against an effect that would move you or knock you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p>\n<hr />\n<p>You react instinctively, sprouting roots from your legs and plunging them deep into the ground to keep your footing. If a force would move you, you move half that distance, to a minimum of 5 feet. If you would be knocked prone, resolve the effect, then you Stand.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Special</strong> This feat gains the trait for your ancestry.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 5
          },
